1,2 $ Fruit-body with distinct veil (Figs. 78,79 & 81) either forming a ring (eg. Figs. 207, 208) or marginal floccules (eg. Figs. 195, 199) to the cap; stem always fibrillose silky
1,14 $ Fruit-body lacking veil; stem pubescent- hoary throughout often becoming smooth (Figs. 76, 77 & 85)
